       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PARTIAL-IO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 TARGET-NAME PIC X(8).
       01 SRC PIC X(8).
       01 REC PIC X(8).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MOVE 'KEEP0001' TO REC.
       MOVE 'SAFE0001' TO SRC.
       WRITE REC FROM SRC.
       CALL REC.
       MOVE 'NEXT0001' TO REC.
       CALL REC.
       CALL SRC.
       GOBACK.
